Package: strawwu-wincompat
Version: __VERSION__
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35)
Maintainer: StrawCoding <apt@wastebase.xyz>
Description: StrawWU Windows compatibility CLI (strawwu)
 Provides the strawwu command-line tool for Windows app compatibility
 on StrawWU. Wave W0 baseline: status, version, and launch stubs.
 Logs to /var/log/strawwu/wincompat.log.
